summary: 
Music is a universal language that transcends borders and brings hearts together. Organised by our non-profit organization, this special Charity Concert invites you to an extraordinary evening of music, warm fellowship, and giving back. Join us as we harness the power of melodies to bring light, hope, and support to our community.

description:
Part I: Nostalgia & Origins
Journey through timeless East Asian classics, featuring soulful renditions of Swan (鸿雁), In That Faraway Place, and That Is Me, awakening deep emotions and heartfelt memories.

Part II: Immortal Classics
Celebrate the grand traditions of opera and world classics. Enjoy Puccini’s sublime O mio babbino caro, the vibrant Italian favorite O Sole Mio, the romantic movie theme Speak Softly Love (from The Godfather), and the beloved folk song The Olive Tree.

Part III: Love & Inspiration
Experience music that uplifts the spirit. Highlights include the globally cherished anthem You Raise Me Up, the inspiring I Love You, China, the legendary Japanese song Subaru, and Rachmaninoff’s dramatic Aleko’s Cavatina.

Grand Finale: Auld Lang Syne & Eternal Friendship
The evening concludes with powerful moving tributes: Remembering Comrades and the iconic Time to Say Goodbye, culminating in a grand joint performance of Auld Lang Syne by our featured artists and the Feige Choir.